{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27883","headline":"震爲苍筤竹 · 朱庆余","name":"震爲苍筤竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲擢东方秀，修然异衆筠。\n青苍才映粉，蒙密正含春。\n嫩箨沾微雨，幽根绝细尘。\n乍怜分径小，偏觉带烟新。\n结实皆留凤，垂阴似庇人。\n顾唯竿在手，深水挂頳鳞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27883.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27883","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}